(In addition to the wrong that would be done by striking the record is the very) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 678 Tm
105 Tz
(significant expense that a new trial would impose on Judge Keller. The SCJC has no) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 648.25 Tm
101 Tz
(such worries, as Mr. McKetta \(one of the original complainants against Judge Keller\) is) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 618.25 Tm
103 Tz
(donating his services to the Commission for one dollar. Judge Keller’s counsel, on the) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 588.25 Tm
100 Tz
(other hand, are prohibited \(under a decision of the Texas Ethics Commission currently on) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 558.5 Tm
104 Tz
(appeal\) from donating their services or even offering them at discounted rates. A new) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 528.5 Tm
100 Tz
(trial would be free for the SCJC \(at least as to attorneys’ fees\), but will cost Judge Keller) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 498.75 Tm
103 Tz
(many thousands of dollars. It simply is unjust to allow the Commission to dramatically) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 468.75 Tm
99 Tz
(escalate the costs of this litigation when it already has been incredibly expensive.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108 439 Tm
103 Tz
(Finally, as already stated in the Motion, the only reason a new trial is possible is) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 408.949 Tm
106 Tz
(because the Commission imposed an unconstitutional sanction against Judge Keller.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 378.949 Tm
101 Tz
(Since the SCJC could not muster the votes for a punishment of censure or removal from) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 349.199 Tm
100 Tz
(office, its only choice was to dismiss the charges. Instead, it issued an illegal punishment) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 319.199 Tm
(so it could try its case yet again. That is not justice; it is vindictiveness.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 289 Tm
123 Tz
/OPBaseFont2 12 Tf
(VI. CONCLUSION) Tj
1 0 0 1 108 262.35 Tm
107 Tz
/OPBaseFont0 13 Tf
(For the reasons set forth herein and in her Motion to Dismiss, The Honorable) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 232.6 Tm
99 Tz
(Sharon Keller, Presiding Judge of the Texas Court of Criminal Appeals, respectfully asks) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 202.6 Tm
111 Tz
(the Court to vacate the July 16, 2010, Order of the State Commission on Judicial) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 172.799 Tm
107 Tz
(Conduct, direct the Commission to expunge that Order from its records, and render) Tj
1 0 0 1 71.049 142.799 Tm
99 Tz
(judgment that all charges against The Honorable Sharon Keller be dismissed.) Tj
