1 0 0 1 72.25 531.599 Tm
(from Judge Cheryl Johnson of the CCA; Dorinda Fox, the runner who called the CCA) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 501.599 Tm
107 Tz
(and decided not to file anything with the Court; Abel Acosta, the deputy clerk who) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 471.599 Tm
99 Tz
(received Ms. Fox’s call; Melissa Waters, another paralegal who worked on Mr. Richard’s) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 441.849 Tm
107 Tz
(case; David Dow, the attorney whose published lies about Judge Keller sparked the) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 411.849 Tm
